%% FIG-010 — Orchestration sequence for one agent task (section 8)
sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Researcher
  participant S as System
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A as Specialist Agent
  R->>S: APR-02 trigger task (after readiness)
  S->>S: Task Queued -> In Progress, Workflow Running
  S->>O: start workflow (task, baseline)
  loop each Workflow Step
    O->>S: create step (agent, inputs, expected outputs)
    S->>S: assemble context (scope, limits)
    S->>A: Agent Run via provider adapter
    A-->>S: handoff envelope + entities
    S->>S: save entities, envelope, checkpoint
    opt decision needed
      O->>S: Interactive Agent Prompt
      S->>R: pending action (Waiting for User)
      R-->>S: response
      S->>O: decision (Context Item)
    end
  end
  O->>S: consolidate results
  S->>S: Workflow Succeeded, Task In Review
  R->>S: APR-03 accept -> Completed
